{"ticker":"LDOS","updated":"2026-10-23T23:13:33Z","profile":{"longName":"Leidos Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"Leidos Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.leidos.com","fullTimeEmployees":50000,"marketCap":17076979712,"trailingPE":12.705882,"forwardPE":10.844445,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.9684121,"pegRatio":2.46,"targetMeanPrice":151.73334,"targetHighPrice":225.0,"targetLowPrice":127.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.072,"earningsGrowth":-0.067,"grossMargins":0.17795,"operatingMargins":0.11715999,"profitMargins":0.07803,"totalRevenue":17634000896,"beta":0.59,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":205.77,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":98.86,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.28},"summary":"Leidos Holdings, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides services and solutions for government and commercial customers in the United States and internationally. The National Security & Digital segment provides national security software; services by using artificial intelligence and machine learning to coordinate sea, ground, air, and space to help warfighters; offensive, defensive, and physical cyber operation solutions; intelligence analysis, operational support, logistics operations, security, linguistics, force production, biometrics, chemical, biological, radiological, nuclear, and explosives, energetics, training, and other services; and Digital Modernization and transformation services. The Health & Civil segment offers air traffic control systems; health mission software; managed health services; infrastructure management and operation; logistical operations and information technology support; and life science research and development support services. The Commercial & International segment provides power grid engineering and design, grid modernization, utility planning and consulting, energy management and efficiency, technology-driven innovation, and software and application development; people scanners, computed tomography carry-on baggage scanners, checked baggage scanners, and explosive trace detectors; mobile, non-intrusive ports and borders inspection sys","summary_zh":"Leidos Holdings, Inc. 及其子公司為美國和國際上的政府和商業客戶提供服務和解決方案。國家安全與數位部門提供國家安全軟體；透過使用人工智慧和機器學習來協調海上、地面、空中和太空來幫助作戰人員提供服務；進攻性、防禦性和物理網路作戰解決方案；情報分析、作戰支援、後勤作戰、安全、語言學、部隊生產、生物識別、化學、生物、放射性、核子與爆炸物、能量學、培訓和其他服務；以及現代化轉型和其他服務；健康與民用部門提供空中交通管制系統；健康使命軟體；管理衛生服務；基礎設施管理和運營；後勤運作和資訊技術支援；和生命科學研究和開發支援服務。商業和國際部門提供電網工程和設計、電網現代化、公用事業規劃和諮詢、能源管理和效率、技術驅動的創新以及軟體和應用程序開發；人員掃描儀、電腦斷層掃描隨身行李掃描儀、托運行李掃描儀和爆炸物微量探測器；移動、非侵入式港口和邊境檢查系統","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"資訊科技服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":181.6,"h":182.37,"l":180.96,"c":181.61,"v":477000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":181.21,"h":182.45,"l":180.39,"c":182.35,"v":686200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":181.93,"h":183.73,"l":181.35,"c":183.39,"v":541700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":183.08,"h":183.5,"l":180.03,"c":181.36,"v":592500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":181.27,"h":182.5,"l":180.04,"c":180.92,"v":671000},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":180.92,"h":181.5,"l":179.36,"c":180.89,"v":596100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":180.77,"h":181.05,"l":176.66,"c":177.71,"v":615500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":177.0,"h":178.58,"l":174.64,"c":178.58,"v":1065100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":179.49,"h":180.17,"l":177.42,"c":179.0,"v":697500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":178.25,"h":178.57,"l":176.34,"c":178.41,"v":641500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":178.25,"h":179.18,"l":176.75,"c":179.03,"v":751100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":178.95,"h":180.49,"l":178.29,"c":180.37,"v":525900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":181.0,"h":185.92,"l":180.71,"c":185.13,"v":851300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":184.82,"h":185.46,"l":183.72,"c":183.86,"v":541400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":182.26,"h":184.38,"l":181.84,"c":182.73,"v":746100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":182.56,"h":183.79,"l":180.84,"c":182.58,"v":904500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":182.59,"h":185.0,"l":181.08,"c":183.8,"v":710600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":183.31,"h":187.57,"l":181.29,"c":